{"files":[{"path":"README.md","lang":"markdown","size":394,"truncated":false,"content":"# Hermes — ساختار شرکت تجاری\n\nنمودار ساختار تجاری Hermes: شخصیت حقوقی، خطوط محصول و واحدهای عملیاتی در یک صفحه.\n\n## Kit\n\n- HTML\n- Docs\n\n## اجرا\n\n```bash\n# مستقیم در مرورگر باز کنید، یا:\npython -m http.server 8000\n```\n\n> سند سازمانی — تک‌فایل، بدون وابستگی.\n"},{"path":"index.html","lang":"xml","size":26232,"truncated":false,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Hermes — ساختار شرکت تجاری</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Vazirmatn:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{--cyan:#22d3ee;--purple:#a78bfa;--green:#34d399;--gold:#fbbf24;--pink:#f472b6;--red:#f87171;--orange:#fb923c;--bg:#06060e;--s:rgba(12,12,24,.92);--b:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--t:#e4e4e7;--d:#71717a}\n*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml{scroll-behavior:smooth}\nbody{font-family:'Vazirmatn','Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--t);min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden}\nbody::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 0%,rgba(34,211,238,.06) 0%,transparent 50%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 100%,rgba(167,139,250,.04) 0%,transparent 50%)}\n.hero{padding:60px 20px 40px;text-align:center;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}\n.hero-badge{display:inline-block;padding:5px 16px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(251,191,36,.1);border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.25);color:var(--gold);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:20px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:1px}\n.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5.5vw,3.2rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:12px}\n.hero h1 .g{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--orange));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}\n.hero .sub{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--d);max-width:650px;margin:0 auto 20px;line-height:1.8}\n.wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}\n\n/* ── ORG TREE ── */\n.org{margin:40px 0;text-align:center}\n.org>h2{text-align:center;font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px}\n.org>.sub-h{text-align:center;color:var(--d);margin-bottom:32px;font-size:.85rem}\n\n.tree-container{overflow-x:auto;padding:20px 0}\n\n/* Node styles */\n.node{display:inline-block;padding:16px 22px;border-radius:16px;text-align:center;min-width:120px;position:relative;border:1px solid var(--b);transition:all .3s;cursor:default}\n.node:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n.node .ni{font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:6px}\n.node .nn{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}\n.node .nd{font-size:.65rem;color:var(--d);margin-top:3px}\n.node .nc{font-size:.6rem;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:6px;display:inline-block;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n/* CEO */\n.node-ceo{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(251,191,36,.08),rgba(251,146,60,.08));border-color:rgba(251,191,36,.25);padding:20px 32px}\n.node-ceo .nn{font-size:1.1rem}\n.node-ceo .nc{background:rgba(251,191,36,.12);color:var(--gold)}\n\n/* VP level */\n.node-vp{background:rgba(167,139,250,.05);border-color:rgba(167,139,250,.2)}\n.node-vp .nc{background:rgba(167,139,250,.1);color:var(--purple)}\n\n/* Dept head */\n.node-dept{background:rgba(34,211,238,.04);border-color:rgba(34,211,238,.15)}\n.node-dept .nc{background:rgba(34,211,238,.1);color:var(--cyan)}\n\n/* Team */\n.node-team{background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.06);padding:12px 16px;min-width:100px}\n.node-team .ni{font-size:1.2rem}\n.node-team .nn{font-size:.78rem}\n.node-team .nc{background:rgba(52,211,153,.1);color:var(--green)}\n\n/* Role */\n.node-role{background:rgba(255,255,255,.015);border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:8px 14px;min-width:80px}\n.node-role .ni{font-size:1rem}\n.node-role .nn{font-size:.7rem}\n\n/* Tree lines */\n.level{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px;position:relative}\n.level::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-16px;left:20%;right:20%;height:2px;background:var(--b)}\n.level.ceo-level::before{display:none}\n\n/* Connector arrows */\n.connector{text-align:center;color:var(--d);font-size:1.2rem;margin:8px 0;line-height:1}\n.connector-branch{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:0;margin:8px 0}\n.connector-branch .c-line{flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--b);align-self:center}\n.connector-branch .c-center{width:2px;height:20px;background:var(--b)}\n\n/* Sub-tree */\n.sub-tree{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}\n.sub-branches{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}\n\n/* Department section */\n.dept-section{margin:40px 0}\n.dept-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--b);background:var(--s)}\n.dept-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;flex-shrink:0}\n.dept-name{font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem}\n.dept-count{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--d);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n.dept-roles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:10px}\n.role-card{padding:14px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);transition:border-color .2s}\n.role-card:hover{border-color:rgba(167,139,250,.15)}\n.role-card .ri{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:6px}\n.role-card .rn{font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:2px}\n.role-card .rd{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--d);line-height:1.6}\n.role-card .rtag{font-size:.6rem;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:5px;display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n/* Stats */\n.stat-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:40px 0}\n.stat{background:var(--s);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;text-align:center}\n.stat .sv{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700}\n.stat .sl{font-size:.65rem;color:var(--d);margin-top:3px}\n\n.footer{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:#3f3f46;font-size:.72rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);margin-top:40px}\n.footer a{color:var(--cyan);text-decoration:none}\n.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:opacity .7s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),transform .7s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}\n.rv.vis{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.rv{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}}\n@media(max-width:768px){.hero{padding:40px 16px 30px}.hero h1{font-size:1.6rem}.dept-roles{grid-template-columns:1fr}.level{gap:6px}.node{min-width:80px;padding:10px 12px}.node .nn{font-size:.75rem}.node .ni{font-size:1.2rem}.stat-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-badge\">COMPANY STRUCTURE — HERMES INC.</div>\n  <h1><span class=\"g\">Hermes</span><br>ساختار شرکت تجاری</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">از CEO تا تیم عملیاتی — ساختار سازمانی یک شرکت AI-First که محصول Hermes رو می‌سازه و می‌فروشه</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n\n<!-- ═══ STATS ═══ -->\n<div class=\"stat-strip rv\">\n  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"sv\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">۱</div><div class=\"sl\">CEO / Founder</div></div>\n  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"sv\" style=\"color:var(--purple)\">۴</div><div class=\"sl\">VP / Director</div></div>\n  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"sv\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">۸</div><div class=\"sl\">دپارتمان</div></div>\n  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"sv\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">۱۲</div><div class=\"sl\">تیم</div></div>\n  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"sv\" style=\"color:var(--pink)\">۳۲</div><div class=\"sl\">نقش</div></div>\n  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"sv\" style=\"color:var(--orange)\">۶</div><div class=\"sl\">AI Agent داخلی</div></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ═══ ORG TREE ═══ -->\n<div class=\"org rv\">\n  <h2>🌳 درخت ساختار سازمانی</h2>\n  <p class=\"sub-h\">هرمس — شرکت AI-First با ۶ Agent داخلی و تیم واقعی</p>\n\n  <div class=\"tree-container\">\n\n    <!-- CEO -->\n    <div class=\"level ceo-level\">\n      <div class=\"node node-ceo\">\n        <div class=\"ni\">👤</div>\n        <div class=\"nn\">KIA (@ImXforever)</div>\n        <div class=\"nd\">CEO / Founder / Chief Architect</div>\n        <div class=\"nc\">v1 — Solo Founder</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"connector\">│</div>\n\n    <!-- VPs -->\n    <div class=\"level\">\n      <div class=\"sub-tree\">\n        <div class=\"node node-vp\">\n          <div class=\"ni\">⚙️</div>\n          <div class=\"nn\">VP Engineering</div>\n          <div class=\"nd\">Hermes Core + AI Infrastructure</div>\n          <div class=\"nc\">رنگ: بنفش</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sub-tree\">\n        <div class=\"node node-vp\">\n          <div class=\"ni\">📈</div>\n          <div class=\"nn\">VP Growth</div>\n          <div class=\"nd\">Marketing + Sales + Partnerships</div>\n          <div class=\"nc\">رنگ: سبز</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sub-tree\">\n        <div class=\"node node-vp\">\n          <div class=\"ni\">💰</div>\n          <div class=\"nn\">VP Finance</div>\n          <div class=\"nd\">Revenue + Treasury + Compliance</div>\n          <div class=\"nc\">رنگ: طلایی</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sub-tree\">\n        <div class=\"node node-vp\">\n          <div class=\"ni\">🎨</div>\n          <div class=\"nn\">VP Product</div>\n          <div class=\"nd\">UX + Design + Content</div>\n          <div class=\"nc\">رنگ: صورتی</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"connector\">│</div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--d);font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:20px\">───────── ۸ دپارتمان ─────────</div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ═══ DEPARTMENT DETAILS ═══ -->\n\n<!-- DEPT 1: Engineering -->\n<div class=\"dept-section rv\">\n  <div class=\"dept-header\">\n    <div class=\"dept-icon\" style=\"background:rgba(167,139,250,.1);color:var(--purple)\">⚙️</div>\n    <div><div class=\"dept-name\">دپارتمان مهندسی — Engineering</div><div class=\"dept-count\">VP Engineering · ۳ تیم · ۸ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">🧠</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم AI Core</div><div class=\"rd\">طراحی و توسعه موتور هوش مصنوعی Hermes</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(167,139,250,.1);color:var(--purple)\">۳ نقش</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">🔧</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Platform</div><div class=\"rd\">زیرساخت، DevOps، دیتابیس، امنیت</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(34,211,238,.1);color:var(--cyan)\">۳ نقش</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">📱</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Frontend</div><div class=\"rd\">وب اپلیکیشن، داشبورد، موبایل</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(52,211,153,.1);color:var(--green)\">۲ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--purple)\"><div class=\"rn\">首席 مهندس AI</div><div class=\"rd\">معماری LangGraph, RL, AGI Roadmap</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--purple)\"><div class=\"rn\">ML Engineer</div><div class=\"rd\">Fine-tuning, Embeddings, Vector DB</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--purple)\"><div class=\"rn\">Prompt Engineer</div><div class=\"rd\">System prompts, Agent behaviors</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--cyan)\"><div class=\"rn\">DevOps / SRE</div><div class=\"rd\">Docker, Railway, CI/CD, Monitoring</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--cyan)\"><div class=\"rn\">Backend Engineer</div><div class=\"rd\">API, Database, Auth, Commerce</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--cyan)\"><div class=\"rn\">Security Engineer</div><div class=\"rd\">Pentest, Guardrails, Compliance</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--green)\"><div class=\"rn\">Frontend Engineer</div><div class=\"rd\">React, Telegram WebApp, Dashboard</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--green)\"><div class=\"rn\">UI/UX Developer</div><div class=\"rd\">Responsive design, Animations</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- DEPT 2: Growth -->\n<div class=\"dept-section rv\">\n  <div class=\"dept-header\">\n    <div class=\"dept-icon\" style=\"background:rgba(52,211,153,.1);color:var(--green)\">📈</div>\n    <div><div class=\"dept-name\">دپارتمان رشد — Growth</div><div class=\"dept-count\">VP Growth · ۳ تیم · ۷ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">📣</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Marketing</div><div class=\"rd\">محتوا، SEO، کمپین، شبکه‌های اجتماعی</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(248,113,113,.1);color:var(--red)\">۳ نقش</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">🤝</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Sales</div><div class=\"rd\">فروش B2B, partnerships, enterprise</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(251,191,36,.1);color:var(--gold)\">۲ نقش</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">👥</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Community</div><div class=\"rd\">کامیونیتی، پشتیبانی، بازخورد</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(244,114,182,.1);color:var(--pink)\">۲ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--red)\"><div class=\"rn\">Content Manager</div><div class=\"rd\">بلاگ، ویدیو، پست اجتماعی</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--red)\"><div class=\"rn\">SEO Specialist</div><div class=\"rd\">rank, keywords, backlinks</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--red)\"><div class=\"rn\">Social Media Manager</div><div class=\"rd\">X, Telegram, LinkedIn</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--gold)\"><div class=\"rn\">Sales Manager</div><div class=\"rd\">B2B pipeline, demos, closing</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--gold)\"><div class=\"rn\">Partnership Lead</div><div class=\"rd\">Integrations, affiliates, resellers</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--pink)\"><div class=\"rn\">Community Manager</div><div class=\"rd\">Discord, Telegram groups, events</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--pink)\"><div class=\"rn\">Customer Success</div><div class=\"rd\">Onboarding, retention, feedback</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- DEPT 3: Finance -->\n<div class=\"dept-section rv\">\n  <div class=\"dept-header\">\n    <div class=\"dept-icon\" style=\"background:rgba(251,191,36,.1);color:var(--gold)\">💰</div>\n    <div><div class=\"dept-name\">دپارتمان مالی — Finance</div><div class=\"dept-count\">VP Finance · ۲ تیم · ۵ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">📊</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Revenue</div><div class=\"rd\">درآمد، pricing، subscriptions</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(251,191,36,.1);color:var(--gold)\">۳ نقش</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">⚖️</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Compliance</div><div class=\"rd\">قوانین، مالیات، KYC</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(167,139,250,.1);color:var(--purple)\">۲ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--gold)\"><div class=\"rn\">Revenue Manager</div><div class=\"rd\">Pricing strategy, MRR tracking</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--gold)\"><div class=\"rn\">Treasury Manager</div><div class=\"rd\">USDT/Crypto treasury, cash flow</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--gold)\"><div class=\"rn\">Financial Analyst</div><div class=\"rd\"> forecasting, unit economics</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--purple)\"><div class=\"rn\">Compliance Officer</div><div class=\"rd\">GDPR, AML, legal</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--purple)\"><div class=\"rn\">KYC Specialist</div><div class=\"rd\">identity verification, fraud</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- DEPT 4: Product -->\n<div class=\"dept-section rv\">\n  <div class=\"dept-header\">\n    <div class=\"dept-icon\" style=\"background:rgba(244,114,182,.1);color:var(--pink)\">🎨</div>\n    <div><div class=\"dept-name\">دپارتمان محصول — Product</div><div class=\"dept-count\">VP Product · ۲ تیم · ۵ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">🎨</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Design</div><div class=\"rd\">UI/UX, برندینگ، موکاپ</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(244,114,182,.1);color:var(--pink)\">۳ نقش</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">📋</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Product</div><div class=\"rd\">Roadmap, user research, specs</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(34,211,238,.1);color:var(--cyan)\">۲ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--pink)\"><div class=\"rn\">Product Designer</div><div class=\"rd\">User flows, wireframes, prototypes</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--pink)\"><div class=\"rn\">Brand Designer</div><div class=\"rd\">Logo, color system, visual identity</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--pink)\"><div class=\"rn\">Motion Designer</div><div class=\"rd\">Animations, Lottie, video</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--cyan)\"><div class=\"rn\">Product Manager</div><div class=\"rd\">Roadmap, priorities, metrics</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--cyan)\"><div class=\"rn\">User Researcher</div><div class=\"rd\">Interviews, surveys, analytics</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- DEPT 5: Operations -->\n<div class=\"dept-section rv\">\n  <div class=\"dept-header\">\n    <div class=\"dept-icon\" style=\"background:rgba(34,211,238,.1);color:var(--cyan)\">🔄</div>\n    <div><div class=\"dept-name\">دپارتمان عملیات — Operations</div><div class=\"dept-count\">Direct Report to CEO · ۲ تیم · ۴ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">🤖</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم AI Operations</div><div class=\"rd\">مدیریت Agentها، monitoring، SLA</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(34,211,238,.1);color:var(--cyan)\">۲ نقش</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\"><div class=\"ri\">📦</div><div class=\"rn\">تیم Logistics</div><div class=\"rd\">فروشگاه، تحویل محصول، پشتیبانی</div><div class=\"rtag\" style=\"background:rgba(52,211,153,.1);color:var(--green)\">۲ نقش</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dept-roles\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--cyan)\"><div class=\"rn\">AI Operations Manager</div><div class=\"rd\">Agent performance, cost, SLA</div></div>\n    <div class=\"role-card\" style=\"border-lef